From Cherry to Cup (一杯咖啡，从一颗果子开始) — Tablet Sketch Explainer (Lemo-Opuscar) · LemoLab × Claude Opus 5.5

No AI-generated images, no stock footage, no outside pictures: paper, pencil lines, colour blocks, stylus and every object
are drawn by the code in this folder.

FONTS (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in fonts/, the .ttf files are local and fetched by tools/fonts.sh)
- Caveat — The Caveat Project Authors — https://github.com/googlefonts/caveat
  (file: https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/caveat), Bold (700) and Medium (500) static instances cut from the
  variable font with fontTools → fonts/Caveat-Bold.ttf, fonts/Caveat-Medium.ttf
- Long Cang — The Long Cang Project Authors — https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/longcang
  subset to tools/zh-longcang.txt → fonts/LongCang-subset.ttf (the Chinese written on the page)
- LXGW WenKai 霞鹜文楷 — LXGW — https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai (Regular v1.245.1)
  subset to tools/zh-subs.txt → fonts/LXGWWenKai-subset.ttf (the Chinese subtitle line)

VOICE
- Kokoro TTS (kokoro-onnx, Apache-2.0; model weights Apache-2.0, hexgrad/Kokoro-82M), voice af_heart, generated locally by
  core/tts/tts.py from voice/lines.json (deterministic; the .wav files are local).

MUSIC SAMPLES (played by core/audio/sampler.py)
- guitar_nylon (Spanish guitar), world_perc (egg shaker): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), CC0 1.0
- jazz_bass (Sneakybass): Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, CC0 1.0
- vibraphone: Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios), CC0 1.0
Pencil, colouring, canvas-gesture, crack, grounds and pour sounds are synthesised by mix.py with core/audio/sfx.py.

